        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 3911S-DD, Solid Brass Square Double Pocket Door Lock Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Set is made for double or French sliding doors where you would like a little privacy such as those leading to bedrooms or bathrooms. This is a complete set, sold with everything you need to secure a set of double doors. The privacy mortise lock is installed on one door and the strike plate is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are tightly hooked together. It is good for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe edge pull is screwed into the door's edge so that you have something to grip in order to slide the door out of the pocket. The square flush pulls are pressure mounted into the door's face. The mortise lock body is easily mounted with two screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via an emergency turn. A privacy lock does not offer security, it offers privacy. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-pocket-door-passage-set-omnia-3911s-p\"><b>Square Passage Pocket Door Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/square-privacy-pocket-door-mortise-lock-omnia-3911s\"><b>Square Privacy Pocket Door Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 3911S-DD Square Double Pocket Door Lock Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Active Trim Length: 2-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Inactive Trim Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Length: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lockbody Depth: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Length: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Faceplate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Pull Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Set:</b> <a href=\"/products/square-privacy-pocket-door-mortise-lock-omnia-3911s\">privacy mortise lock body</a>, two (2) flush pulls for the locking door, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-cup-pull-omnia-7504-52\">two (2) flush pulls for the non-locking door</a>, <a href=\"/products/sliding-pocket-door-edge-pull-omnia-3917\">two (2) edge pulls</a>, strike plate, and all mounting hardware. For One Pair of Pocket Doors. (2 doors).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
