                "title": "Contemporary Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Set",
                "description": "Omnia 3911S-DD, Contemporary Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Set - The Contemporary Solid Brass Double Pocket Door Privacy Set is made for double or French sliding doors where you would like a little privacy such as those leading to bedrooms or bathrooms. This is a complete set, sold with everything you need to secure a set of double doors. The privacy mortise lock is installed on one door and the strike plate is installed on the other door. When locked, the two pocket doors are tightly hooked together. It is good for doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2 inch backset.\r\n",
